/T (The CHT is the digital platform that the Government of Nepal is using for its ongoing pilot project. This project utilizes licensed, well-trained, and supervised community health nurses \(CHNs\) to deliver a life-cycle approach-based care through regular home visits. The migration of a substantial volume of prehistoric longitudinal data to an open-source system owned by the Government is a pioneering global practice. This will enable the eventual integration and adoption of the CHSP program by the local government.)
/E (The CHT is the digital platform that the Government of Nepal is using for its ongoing pilot project. This project utilizes licensed, well-trained, and supervised community health nurses \(CHNs\) to deliver a life-cycle approach-based care through regular home visits. The migration of a substantial volume of prehistoric longitudinal data to an open-source system owned by the Government is a pioneering global practice. This will enable the eventual integration and adoption of the CHSP program by the local government.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
